<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Profil Bidang Akademik</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/landing-page/css/main.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/landing-page/css/responsive.css">
  <link rel="web icon" href="<%= (siteSetting && siteSetting.favicon) ? siteSetting.favicon : '/assets/landing-page/images/favicon.ico' %>">
  <style>
    :root {
      --profile-primary: #0d9394;
      --profile-primary-dark: #0b6c6d;
      --profile-ink: #0f172a;
      --profile-muted: #64748b;
      --profile-soft: #f8fafc;
      --profile-border: #e2e8f0;
      --profile-success: #166534;
      --profile-success-soft: #dcfce7;
    }
    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }
    .profile-shell {
      position: relative;
    }
    .profile-shell::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0 0 auto 0;
      height: 680px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 10%, rgba(13, 147, 148, 0.12), transparent 38%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 4%, rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.14), transparent 34%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }
    .profile-layer {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .profile-hero-title {
      max-width: 920px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .profile-hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 7px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.26);
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    }
    .profile-quick-nav {
      display: inline-flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 14px;
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }
    .profile-anchor {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 8px 13px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid #dcfce7;
      background: #f0fdf4;
      color: var(--profile-success);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 140ms ease;
    }
    .profile-anchor:hover {
      background: #dcfce7;
      color: #14532d;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }
    .profile-stat-grid {
      margin-top: 16px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(130px, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .profile-stat-item {
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.28);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
      color: #ffffff;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .profile-stat-label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.4px;
      opacity: 0.85;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .profile-stat-value {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }
    .profile-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--profile-border);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 34px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .profile-card-soft {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f8fcff 100%);
    }
    .profile-card-heading {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .profile-title {
      color: var(--profile-ink);
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .profile-subtext {
      color: var(--profile-muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .profile-bullet-list {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .profile-bullet-list li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 9px;
      color: #1f2937;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .profile-bullet-list li::before {
      content: "\f00c";
      font-family: "Font Awesome 6 Free";
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 10px;
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      flex: 0 0 20px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 4px;
      color: #14532d;
      background: var(--profile-success-soft);
      border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
    }
    .profile-focus-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }
    .profile-focus-item {
      border: 1px solid var(--profile-border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 12px;
      background: #ffffff;
    }
    .profile-focus-item h6 {
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      color: var(--profile-ink);
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .profile-focus-item p {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: var(--profile-muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .unit-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .unit-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--profile-border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.07);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transition: all 140ms ease;
      height: 100%;
    }
    .unit-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
    }
    .unit-thumb {
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      background: #f1f5f9;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .unit-thumb img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
      transition: transform 220ms ease;
    }
    .unit-card:hover .unit-thumb img {
      transform: scale(1.04);
    }
    .unit-body {
      padding: 14px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      height: 100%;
      gap: 9px;
    }
    .unit-name {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--profile-ink);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .unit-desc {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--profile-muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      display: -webkit-box;
      -webkit-line-clamp: 4;
      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
      overflow: hidden;
      min-height: 88px;
    }
    .unit-link-chip {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dff6df 0%, #c7efc7 100%);
      border: 1px solid #8bd68b;
      color: #0a4a1f;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
      max-width: 100%;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(10, 74, 31, 0.16);
      transition: transform 120ms ease, box-shadow 120ms ease;
      word-break: break-all;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-top: auto;
    }
    .unit-link-chip:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(10, 74, 31, 0.22);
      color: #0a4a1f;
    }
    .unit-link-chip i { color: #0aa83f; }
    .unit-link-chip span {
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .layanan-link {
      height: 100%;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid var(--profile-border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
      padding: 16px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--profile-ink);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      transition: all 120ms ease;
    }
    .layanan-link:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: #86efac;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(22, 101, 52, 0.16);
      color: var(--profile-ink);
    }
    .layanan-icon {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      flex: 0 0 42px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #ffffff;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--profile-primary), var(--profile-primary-dark));
      box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(13, 147, 148, 0.28);
    }
    .layanan-copy {
      flex-grow: 1;
    }
    .layanan-copy h5 {
      margin-bottom: 2px;
      color: var(--profile-ink);
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .layanan-copy p {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: var(--profile-muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .layanan-arrow {
      color: #0f766e;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .kontak-item {
      border: 1px solid var(--profile-border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 14px;
      background: #ffffff;
      height: 100%;
    }
    .kontak-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--profile-muted);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .kontak-value {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--profile-ink);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0;
      word-break: break-word;
    }
    .kontak-cta {
      border: 1px solid var(--profile-border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #f0fdfa, #ecfeff);
      height: 100%;
    }
    .kontak-cta p {
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .kontak-cta .btn {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    @media (max-width: 1199px) {
      .unit-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }
    }
    @media (max-width: 991px) {
      .profile-stat-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(130px, 1fr));
      }
      .unit-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }
    }
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      .profile-card {
        padding: 18px;
      }
      .profile-quick-nav {
        padding: 8px;
      }
      .profile-anchor {
        font-size: 12px;
        padding: 7px 10px;
      }
      .unit-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .profile-focus-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include("../partials/landing-header") %>
  <%- include("../partials/landing-aside") %>

  <main class="profile-shell">
    <div class="profile-layer">
      <%
        const data = profileContent || {};
        const misi = Array.isArray(data.misi) ? data.misi : [];
        const tugas = Array.isArray(data.tugas) ? data.tugas : [];
        const fungsi = Array.isArray(data.fungsi) ? data.fungsi : [];
        const unitCount = Array.isArray(units) ? units.length : 0;
        const kontakEmail = (data && data.kontakEmail) || (siteSetting && siteSetting.kontakEmail) || 'akademik@unjani.ac.id';
        const kontakTelepon = (data && data.kontakTelepon) || (siteSetting && siteSetting.kontakTelepon) || '+62 (022) 6656190';
        const alamatLayanan = (data && data.alamatLayanan) || (siteSetting && siteSetting.alamat) || 'Jl. Terusan Jend. Sudirman, Cibeber, Kec. Cimahi Selatan, Kota Cimahi, Jawa Barat';
        const jamLayanan = (data && data.jamLayanan) || 'Senin-Jumat, 08.00-15.30 WIB';
        const layananLinks = [
          { href: '/kalender-akademik', label: 'Kalender Akademik', icon: 'fa-calendar-days' },
          { href: '/kurikulum', label: 'Kurikulum', icon: 'fa-book-open' },
          { href: '/dokumen-akademik', label: 'Dokumen Akademik', icon: 'fa-file-lines' },
          { href: '/rpl', label: 'RPL', icon: 'fa-layer-group' },
          { href: '/akreditasi', label: 'Akreditasi', icon: 'fa-award' },
          { href: '/pengumuman', label: 'Pengumuman', icon: 'fa-bullhorn' }
        ];
      %>

      <div class="section-wrapper pb-0">
        <div class="section-banner-inner banner-inner-about" style="background-image: url('<%= (siteSetting && siteSetting.bannerRpl) ? siteSetting.bannerRpl : '/assets/landing-page/images/hero-bg.jpg' %>'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;">
          <div class="hero-container">
            <div class="d-flex flex-column gspace-2 text-center justify-content-center profile-hero-title">
              <div>
                <span class="profile-hero-badge">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns"></i> Bidang Akademik Unjani
                </span>
              </div>
              <h1 class="secondary-accent"><%= (data && data.judulHalaman) || 'Profil Bidang Akademik' %></h1>
              <p class="text-white mb-1">Informasi inti Bidang Akademik Universitas Jenderal Achmad Yani untuk mendukung layanan akademik sivitas internal secara terstruktur.</p>
              <nav class="breadcrumb justify-content-center">
                <a href="/" class="breadcrumb-item">Beranda</a>
                <span class="breadcrumb-icon">/</span>
                <span class="breadcrumb-item recent">Profil</span>
              </nav>
              <div class="profile-quick-nav">
                <a href="#ringkasan" class="profile-anchor"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-lines"></i>Ringkasan</a>
                <a href="#visi-misi" class="profile-anchor"><i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i>Visi Misi</a>
                <a href="#tugas-fungsi" class="profile-anchor"><i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i>Tugas Fungsi</a>
                <a href="#unit" class="profile-anchor"><i class="fa-solid fa-building"></i>Unit</a>
                <a href="#kontak" class="profile-anchor"><i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i>Kontak</a>
              </div>
              <div class="profile-stat-grid">
                <div class="profile-stat-item">
                  <span class="profile-stat-label">Unit</span>
                  <span class="profile-stat-value"><%= unitCount %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="profile-stat-item">
                  <span class="profile-stat-label">Butir Misi</span>
                  <span class="profile-stat-value"><%= misi.length %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="profile-stat-item">
                  <span class="profile-stat-label">Butir Tugas</span>
                  <span class="profile-stat-value"><%= tugas.length %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="profile-stat-item">
                  <span class="profile-stat-label">Butir Fungsi</span>
                  <span class="profile-stat-value"><%= fungsi.length %></span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section" id="ringkasan">
        <div class="hero-container">
          <div class="row row-cols-xl-2 row-cols-1 grid-spacer-2">
            <div class="col">
              <div class="profile-card profile-card-soft h-100">
                <div class="profile-card-heading">
                  <div class="sub-heading mb-0">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle accent-color-2"></i>
                    <span class="sub-heading-title">Ringkasan Bidang Akademik</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <h3 class="profile-title mb-2">Peran Strategis Bidang Akademik</h3>
                <p class="profile-subtext"><%= (data && data.ringkasan) || '-' %></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <div class="profile-card h-100">
                <div class="profile-card-heading">
                  <div class="sub-heading mb-0">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle accent-color-2"></i>
                    <span class="sub-heading-title">Ruang Lingkup Layanan</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <h3 class="profile-title mb-2">Fokus Pelayanan Internal</h3>
                <ul class="profile-bullet-list">
                  <li>Koordinasi administrasi akademik lintas unit, fakultas, dan program studi.</li>
                  <li>Pengelolaan dokumen akademik dan informasi layanan yang terukur.</li>
                  <li>Sinkronisasi agenda akademik untuk menjaga ketertiban proses belajar.</li>
                  <li>Dukungan layanan berbasis data untuk kebutuhan sivitas internal.</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="profile-focus-grid">
                  <div class="profile-focus-item">
                    <h6>Orientasi Layanan</h6>
                    <p>Tertib, cepat, dan akuntabel.</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="profile-focus-item">
                    <h6>Output Utama</h6>
                    <p>Informasi akademik yang jelas dan dapat ditindaklanjuti.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section pt-0" id="visi-misi">
        <div class="hero-container">
          <div class="row row-cols-xl-2 row-cols-1 grid-spacer-2">
            <div class="col">
              <div class="profile-card h-100">
                <div class="profile-card-heading">
                  <div class="sub-heading mb-0">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle accent-color-2"></i>
                    <span class="sub-heading-title">Visi</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <h3 class="profile-title mb-2">Arah Pengembangan</h3>
                <p class="profile-subtext"><%= (data && data.visi) || '-' %></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <div class="profile-card h-100">
                <div class="profile-card-heading">
                  <div class="sub-heading mb-0">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle accent-color-2"></i>
                    <span class="sub-heading-title">Misi</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <h3 class="profile-title mb-2">Komitmen Pelaksanaan</h3>
                <ul class="profile-bullet-list">
                  <% if (misi.length) { %>
                    <% misi.forEach(function(item){ %>
                      <li><%= item %></li>
                    <% }); %>
                  <% } else { %>
                    <li>-</li>
                  <% } %>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section pt-0" id="tugas-fungsi">
        <div class="hero-container">
          <div class="row row-cols-xl-2 row-cols-1 grid-spacer-2">
            <div class="col">
              <div class="profile-card h-100">
                <div class="profile-card-heading">
                  <div class="sub-heading mb-0">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle accent-color-2"></i>
                    <span class="sub-heading-title">Tugas</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <h3 class="profile-title mb-2">Tugas Inti</h3>
                <ul class="profile-bullet-list">
                  <% if (tugas.length) { %>
                    <% tugas.forEach(function(item){ %>
                      <li><%= item %></li>
                    <% }); %>
                  <% } else { %>
                    <li>-</li>
                  <% } %>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <div class="profile-card h-100">
                <div class="profile-card-heading">
                  <div class="sub-heading mb-0">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle accent-color-2"></i>
                    <span class="sub-heading-title">Fungsi</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <h3 class="profile-title mb-2">Fungsi Pendukung</h3>
                <ul class="profile-bullet-list">
                  <% if (fungsi.length) { %>
                    <% fungsi.forEach(function(item){ %>
                      <li><%= item %></li>
                    <% }); %>
                  <% } else { %>
                    <li>-</li>
                  <% } %>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section pt-0" id="unit">
        <div class="hero-container">
          <div class="profile-card">
            <div class="profile-card-heading">
              <div>
                <div class="sub-heading mb-2">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-circle accent-color-2"></i>
                  <span class="sub-heading-title">Unit di Bidang Akademik</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="profile-title mb-0">Unit Pendukung Akademik</h3>
              </div>
              <span class="badge accent-bg text-white px-3 py-2">Total: <%= unitCount %> Unit</span>
            </div>

            <% if (units && units.length) { %>
              <div class="unit-grid mt-2">
                <% units.forEach(function(u){ %>
                  <div class="unit-card">
                    <div class="unit-thumb">
                      <img src="<%= u.img || '/assets/landing-page/images/dummy-img-600x400.jpg' %>" alt="<%= u.nama %>">
                    </div>
                    <div class="unit-body">
                      <h4 class="unit-name"><%= u.nama %></h4>
                      <p class="unit-desc"><%= u.deskripsi || 'Deskripsi belum tersedia.' %></p>
                      <% if (u.link) { %>
                        <% const friendlyLink = (u.link || '').replace(/^https?:\/\//i, '').replace(/\/$/, ''); %>
                        <a href="<%= u.link %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="unit-link-chip w-100" title="<%= u.link %>">
                          <i class="fa-solid fa-link"></i>
                          <span><%= friendlyLink %></span>
                          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square ms-auto"></i>
                        </a>
                      <% } %>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                <% }); %>
              </div>
            <% } else { %>
              <div class="alert alert-warning text-center mt-2 mb-0">Belum ada data unit.</div>
            <% } %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section pt-0">
        <div class="hero-container">
          <div class="profile-card">
            <div class="profile-card-heading">
              <div>
                <div class="sub-heading mb-2">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-circle accent-color-2"></i>
                  <span class="sub-heading-title">Layanan Akademik Terkait</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="profile-title mb-0">Akses Cepat Layanan</h3>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row row-cols-xl-3 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-1 grid-spacer-2 mt-1">
              <% layananLinks.forEach(function(link){ %>
                <div class="col">
                  <a href="<%= link.href %>" class="layanan-link">
                    <span class="layanan-icon"><i class="fa-solid <%= link.icon %>"></i></span>
                    <div class="layanan-copy">
                      <h5><%= link.label %></h5>
                      <p>Buka halaman layanan</p>
                    </div>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right layanan-arrow"></i>
                  </a>
                </div>
              <% }); %>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section pt-0" id="kontak">
        <div class="hero-container">
          <div class="profile-card">
            <div class="profile-card-heading">
              <div>
                <div class="sub-heading mb-2">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-circle accent-color-2"></i>
                  <span class="sub-heading-title">Kontak Layanan Bidang Akademik</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="profile-title mb-0">Informasi Kontak</h3>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row row-cols-xl-2 row-cols-1 grid-spacer-2 mt-1">
              <div class="col">
                <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 grid-spacer-2">
                  <div class="col">
                    <div class="kontak-item">
                      <div class="kontak-label">Email</div>
                      <p class="kontak-value"><%= kontakEmail %></p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col">
                    <div class="kontak-item">
                      <div class="kontak-label">Telepon</div>
                      <p class="kontak-value"><%= kontakTelepon %></p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col">
                    <div class="kontak-item">
                      <div class="kontak-label">Alamat Layanan</div>
                      <p class="kontak-value"><%= alamatLayanan %></p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col">
                    <div class="kontak-item">
                      <div class="kontak-label">Jam Layanan</div>
                      <p class="kontak-value"><%= jamLayanan %></p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col">
                <div class="kontak-cta">
                  <h4 class="mb-2">Butuh Bantuan Layanan Akademik?</h4>
                  <p>Gunakan kanal resmi Bidang Akademik untuk pertanyaan administrasi akademik, kebutuhan dokumen, dan informasi layanan internal lainnya.</p>
                  <div class="d-flex flex-column gspace-2">
                    <a href="mailto:<%= kontakEmail %>" class="btn btn-accent">
                      <span class="btn-title">Kirim Email</span>
                      <span class="icon-circle"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i></span>
                    </a>
                    <a href="tel:<%= String(kontakTelepon).replace(/[^0-9+]/g, '') %>" class="btn btn-accent">
                      <span class="btn-title">Hubungi Telepon</span>
                      <span class="icon-circle"><i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i></span>
                    </a>
                    <a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=<%= encodeURIComponent(alamatLayanan) %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-accent">
                      <span class="btn-title">Lihat Lokasi</span>
                      <span class="icon-circle"><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i></span>
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include("../partials/landing-footer") %>

  <script src="/assets/landing-page/js/vendor/jquery.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/assets/landing-page/js/vendor/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/assets/landing-page/js/vendor/swiper-bundle.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/assets/landing-page/js/vendor/isotope.pkgd.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/assets/landing-page/js/vendor/flatpickr.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/assets/landing-page/js/script.js"></script>
  <script src="/assets/landing-page/js/submit-form.js"></script>
  <script src="/assets/landing-page/js/swiper-script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
